                    "description": {
                      "source": "",
                      "engine": "wysiwyg",
                      "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>*** Camp is Full ***</strong></h3><h4 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Please email about waitlist options</strong></h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">In this watercolor camp, students learn washes, layering and color mixing, and paint landscapes and still lifes.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Each day starts with a short demonstration, followed by time to work on their own paintings.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Camp Info</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ages 8-12</p></li></ul><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">July 27 - July 31 : 11:30am - 4:30pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tuition: $280</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Discounts (one per family):</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Early bird (register by 4/20/2025): 10% off tuition</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Siblings: 10% off tuition</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Students should bring a snack, water and a sketchbook. Aprons are provided, but please wear clothes that can get paint on them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our camps are a relaxed, welcoming place to make friends and learn about art.</p>"
